{"id": "industry-learning", "status": "published", "category": "研究方向", "title": "產業學習", "subtitle": "從台美產業交流現場，學習供應鏈、在地信任與跨境市場進入。", "cover": {"src": "/assets/experience/industry-learning-venture-cafe.png", "width": 810, "height": 542, "fit": "contain", "background": "#1c1813", "srcset": "/assets/responsive/industry-learning-venture-cafe-386859f2194a-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/industry-learning-venture-cafe-386859f2194a-810.webp 810w"}, "html": "<section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>活動當時的學習心得</h3><p>很感謝有機會在現場觀察並學習 Arizona 與台灣半導體及供應鏈生態系的交流。</p><p>特別感謝台灣代表團，以及亞利桑那州駐台貿易投資辦事處徐竹先處長的指導，讓這次學習機會成為可能。</p><p>當時身為 ASU 供應鏈研究生，並帶著九年的海外經驗，我最大的體會是：台灣企業進入美國市場，不只是技術或資本的問題，也需要重新建立資訊可見度、信任、在地合作關係，以及實際營運的準備。</p><p>另一個讓我印象深刻的觀察，是認識了幾位同樣活躍於日語商業環境的企業家與專業人士。隨著 Arizona、台灣與熊本之間的半導體合作架構逐漸清晰，我認為未來美國、台灣與日本在供應鏈、人才和市場進入方面，有很大的合作潛力。</p><p>我仍在這段旅程的起點，希望持續學習，未來成為連結亞洲商業執行與美國供應鏈生態系的實用橋梁。</p></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>產業交流現場</h3><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline note-gallery-compact note-gallery-pair\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-mou-signing.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-mou-signing.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/industry-learning-mou-signing-ce4e8852835f-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/industry-learning-mou-signing-ce4e8852835f-812.webp 812w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"台美產業合作 MOU 簽署現場。\" width=\"812\" height=\"541\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>台美產業合作 MOU 簽署現場。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-venture-cafe.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-venture-cafe.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/industry-learning-venture-cafe-386859f2194a-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/industry-learning-venture-cafe-386859f2194a-810.webp 810w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"Venture Café 台美產業交流現場。\" width=\"810\" height=\"542\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Venture Café 台美產業交流現場。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-event-dinner.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-event-dinner.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/industry-learning-event-dinner-7e5d26ccfb98-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/industry-learning-event-dinner-7e5d26ccfb98-959.webp 959w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"當天晚宴合影。\" width=\"959\" height=\"841\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>當天晚宴合影。</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>與產業前輩合影</h3><p>這次的機會特別感謝亞利桑那州駐台貿易投資辦事處徐竹先處長，讓我有機會學習產業，也認識許多前輩。</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline note-gallery-compact note-gallery-trio\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-steve-hsu.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-steve-hsu.png\" alt=\"與亞利桑那州駐台貿易投資辦事處徐竹先處長合影。\" width=\"430\" height=\"565\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>與亞利桑那州駐台貿易投資辦事處徐竹先處長合影。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-james-huang.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-james-huang.png\" alt=\"與中華民國對外貿易發展協會董事長黃志芳合影。\" width=\"432\" height=\"574\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>與中華民國對外貿易發展協會董事長黃志芳合影。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-chiao.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-chiao.png\" alt=\"與嘉惠集團總裁喬培偉合影。\" width=\"433\" height=\"570\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>與嘉惠集團總裁喬培偉合影。</figcaption></figure></div></section>", "pending": "完整文章準備中。", "close": "關閉"}